<title>FRANCE: India buys 125,000 tonnes Australian wheat -trade.</title>
<headline>India buys 125,000 tonnes Australian wheat -trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India has bought 125,000 tonnes of Australian wheat at $156 per tonne, Fob, for delivery in March, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>India was seeking 50,000 tonnes of optional-origin wheat for March delivery.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
